    "rationale": "All three selected CAS records are preserved specimens with species rank, a source locality and waterBody Lake Taal, exact collection dates, and a CC0 1.0 record/dataset license. The accepted GBIF names and taxon keys are pinned; the original Microphis jagorii usage remains visible beside its accepted combination Oostethus jagorii. Eleven additional rows in the bounded query resolve only to genus or family rank and are not projected.",
