    "publicationApproval": false
  },
  "caveats": [
    "The query is limited to one CAS dataset, one Philippines country filter, preserved-specimen records and the exact waterBody string Lake Taal. It does not represent a complete Taal species inventory.",
    "The three historical source records have a GBIF CONTINENT_INVALID quality flag; their explicit Lake Taal waterBody and locality text support text-locality evidence only. This flag is retained and no coordinate is shown.",
    "The two 2011 rows lack coordinate uncertainty. The 1931 Scatophagus argus record reports 12,567 m uncertainty. None is projected as a point or geometry.",
    "The remaining eleven query rows resolve only to genus or family rank. They are not species assertions and are not interpreted as absence of any species.",
    "The Microphis jagorii recorded name is mapped by GBIF to accepted Oostethus jagorii; the recorded name and synonym status are retained so the source change is auditable.",
    "These records do not establish current presence, abundance, a complete lake checklist, diet, catchability, fishing access, legality, safety or presence in any other waterbody."
